		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="mes_shop_02_03_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ＮＯ．[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]「[Name:Move Idx="1" ]」ですね
[Digit:5digits Idx="2" ]円に　なりますが？</Text>
