		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ＮＯ．[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]「[Name:Move Idx="1" ]」ですね
[Digit:5digits Idx="2" ]円に　なりますが？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
